Row 1 (left to right):
1. A heater shield facing front with a thick rim, broad rays fanning out behind it, a flame, an ice crystal and a lightning bolt cut into its face as white gaps.
2. A heater shield facing front with a thick rim, a flared cross cut through its face as a white gap, broad rays of light fanning out behind it.
3. Three identical swords fanned out in an arc like afterimages, one thick curved slash trail behind them.

Row 2 (left to right):
4. A sword standing on a slight tilt, thick flames curling up around the blade.
5. A greatsword swung flat in a wide horizontal arc, one thick crescent sweep trail along its edge.
6. A thick plain circular ring with a big clenched fist punching up inside it.

Row 3 (left to right):
7. A thick plain circular ring with one broad spread wing inside it.
8. A thick plain circular ring with a heater shield inside it.
9. A thick plain circular ring with one tall flame rising inside it.
